          "jcr:created": "Fri Aug 08 2025 16:07:56 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">At this year’s ASSH Annual Meeting, we’re showing up with intention, for you, your patients, and the future of hand and wrist care. We are full force is more than a message; it reflects our total commitment to you and your patients, supporting you in delivering the highest quality care today, while continuously investing in what’s next.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">This is your first look at what we’re bringing to ASSH, our latest innovations, hands-on experiences, and meaningful ways to connect. We are looking forward to connecting with you.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Aug 08 2025 16:18:34 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
